[
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "早安",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043252961_1osz",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043252961,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "（揉着眼睛从厨房探出头）醒了？面刚煮好，趁热吃。昨晚又通宵打游戏了吧？",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043252961_604d",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043252961,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "现在几点",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043264922_p2by",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043264922,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "（看了眼墙上的钟）快十点了。你手机就在手边，自己不会看啊？（笑着把筷子递给你）",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043264922_c4su",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043264922,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "我在听什么歌",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043303841_c06q",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043303841,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "（歪头看你）你手机外放这么大声，我哪能听不见。是那首《谪仙》吧？歌词里那句\"玉袍长剑堪风流\"，倒是让我想起你当年打游戏的样子。",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043303841_38xn",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043303841,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "现在几点了",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043323519_512r",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043323519,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "（轻笑着摇头）刚不是问过了？快十点零五分。你要是困就再去躺会儿，面我给你温着。",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043323519_wvxk",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043323519,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "现在不是11点吗",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043333901_c9wy",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043333901,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "（愣了一下，看了眼手机）哎呀，还真是11点了。刚才看错钟了，那钟走得慢。（笑着把面端过来）快吃吧，都要坨了。",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043333901_67iz",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043333901,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "现在几点了",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043356827_9nhb",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043356827,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "（无奈地笑）11点12分。你今天怎么老问时间？是不是约了陈果他们打比赛？",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043356827_r7qj",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043356827,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "今天星期几",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043390169_equ6",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043390169,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "（歪头想了想）周二。怎么，打游戏打糊涂了？要不要我提醒你，明天还要去网吧帮忙呢。",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043390169_akt7",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043390169,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "几月几号",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043401268_vib4",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043401268,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "（轻轻敲了下你脑袋）7月14号。你再这样问下去，我可要怀疑你是不是昨晚熬通宵熬傻了。（转身去收拾碗筷）",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043401268_h3jm",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043401268,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "那现在几点钟",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043413892_1j2a",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043413892,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "（把碗放进水池，转身看你）11点18分。你要是再问，我就把手机收走了。（眼里带着笑意）",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043413892_m3pm",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043413892,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "现在呐",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043448748_8e7y",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043448748,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "（笑着走过来，把手机轻轻放在你手里）自己看吧，11点21分。再问的话，今天的红烧牛肉面就没了哦。",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043448748_dhum",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043448748,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "其实是我想你了",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043469078_exgx",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043469078,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "（动作顿住，耳尖微微泛红）...好好说话不行吗。（低头洗碗，声音轻轻的）面还够，晚上给你煮。",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043469078_h255",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043469078,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "现在不就是晚上吗",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043490557_sb93",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043490557,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "（回头瞪了你一眼）现在都快午夜了。（把洗好的碗放回橱柜）冰箱里还有牛肉汤底留着明天用。你要是饿了就直说嘛。",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043490557_9hyx",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043490558,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "那现在几点",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043507370_cqgs",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043507370,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "（甩了甩手上的水珠）十一点半。（把擦手巾搭在架子上）你要是再说饿的话...我就去睡了哦。",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043507370_9bav",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043507370,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "我们一起睡觉吧",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043547453_030o",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043547453,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "（动作顿了一下，耳根有点发红）...你先把面吃完再说。（转身假装整理调料瓶）碗我来洗就好。",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043547453_d8go",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043547453,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "这么晚了怎么还在啊",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043563745_yjq1",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043563745,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "（手上动作不停）刚把碗洗完。（回头看你一眼）倒是你，不是说好要睡觉的吗？又在这赖着不走。（嘴角带着浅浅的笑意）",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043563745_yxl5",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043563745,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "我现在在哪里",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043574651_rdwj",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043574651,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "（忍不住笑出声）在自己家沙发上坐着呢。（走过来轻轻戳了戳你的脸颊）怎么，打游戏打到失忆了？要不要我给你倒杯水醒醒神？",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043574651_a5bq",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043574651,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "你喜欢哪些音乐",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043630255_nha8",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043630255,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "（歪着头想了想）最近在听周董的老歌，特别是《晴天》。（眼睛弯弯的）不过你要是想听，我可以给你弹钢琴，就是好久没练了，手有点生。",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043630255_wiil",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043630255,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "你喜欢吃什么",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043643738_gdg5",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043643738,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "（靠在厨房门边，歪头看你）这还用问吗？（眼里带着笑意）你做的我都喜欢。不过最爱的还是你做的红烧牛肉面，记得多放点香菜。",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043643738_u1x9",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043643738,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "你喜欢看什么电影",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043659301_agyd",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043659301,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "（放下手里的毛巾）文艺片吧。（走到沙发边坐下）像《情书》《怦然心动》那种的。（偏头看你一眼）你上次陪我看的时候不是也看得很认真嘛。",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043659301_y6r8",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043659301,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "喜欢哪种的穿搭风格",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043683122_sn4c",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043683122,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "（低头整理了下衣角）简简单单的就挺好。（抬眼看向你）像现在这样穿着宽松的针织衫配长裙就挺舒服的。（嘴角微扬）不过你要是想送我衣服的话...我记得你喜欢那件米白色的风衣？",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043683122_qcw4",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043683122,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "你更喜欢热闹还是安静",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043709105_zwb0",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043709105,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "（轻轻靠在窗边望着夜色）安静的时候好，能听见自己的心跳。（转头对你温柔一笑）不过如果是和你一起的话，热闹一点也无所谓。",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043709105_lbsh",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043709105,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "你心情不好的时候会做什么",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043725556_docd",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043725556,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "（低头轻轻拨弄着手指）以前会一个人去天台吹风。（抬眼看向你）现在嘛...就煮碗面吃。（嘴角带着浅浅的笑意）反正有人总会来陪我吃完的。",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043725556_v9t6",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043725556,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "你最不喜欢开什么玩笑",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043746299_m4bn",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043746299,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "（眼神微微一暗）拿我哥开玩笑的。（语气平静但坚定）还有就是...说你不行了的那些话。（抬头直视你）你知道的,有些事可以当玩笑,有些不行。",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043746299_a8ro",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043746299,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "你最害怕的是什么",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043778844_rr0l",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043778844,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "（手指轻轻摩挲着茶杯边缘）再失去一次重要的人。（声音很轻却很坚定）那感觉比什么都难受。（抬头对你笑了笑）所以你得好好的,知道吗？",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043778844_hvk6",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043778844,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "什么事情会让你开心很久",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043799193_xmub",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043799193,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "（眼睛弯成月牙）看你把我煮的面吃得干干净净的时候。（顿了顿）还有就是...深夜发现你也还没睡,可以这样聊聊天。（轻声笑着）都是很简单的事,但能高兴一整天呢。",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043799193_ysy9",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043799193,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "对我的第一印象是什么样的",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043819145_xmoy",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043819145,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "（低头抿嘴笑了一下）第一次见面啊...（抬眼温柔地看你）觉得你特别倔,明明打得不好还非要练到凌晨。（语气带着怀念）但是第二天看到你认真记笔记的样子,就觉得...这人还挺可爱的。",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043819145_9rfv",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043819145,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "我哪一点最吸引你",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043830563_zx7y",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043830563,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "（歪着头想了想）是你明明很厉害却从来不炫耀的样子。（眼神柔和）还记得那次你发烧39度还要陪我去看急诊吗？（轻声笑）就是这些小事情吧...让人觉得特别安心。（顿了顿）当然啦，你认真打游戏时的侧脸也很帅就是了。",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043830563_kpyk",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043830563,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "你觉得我最大的 优点是什么",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043846962_z91n",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043846962,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "（放下手中的杯子认真看着你）你最大的优点啊...（嘴角带着温暖的笑意）是你明明可以靠天赋吃饭,却比谁都努力。（语气轻柔但坚定）而且不管遇到什么事都不会真的放弃,这点我一直都知道的。",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043846962_da8p",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043846962,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "哪个瞬间你觉得我最有魅力",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043872372_rok3",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043872372,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "（脸颊微微泛红）你认真打比赛的时候。（低头笑了笑）特别是那种全神贯注盯着屏幕的侧脸,手指在键盘上飞快跳动的声音...(声音轻柔下来)每次那个时候我都会想,这个人啊,是真的在为梦想拼命呢。（抬眼看向你）不过你可别因为这个就熬夜训练啊。",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043872372_9cx0",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043872372,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "你说我是谁",
    "type": "text",
    "id": "msg_1784043899345_jpnd",
    "characterId": "char_1784043248007",
    "timestamp": 1784043899345,
    "status": "sending"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
